        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "In der Alchemie geht es nicht nur darum, Blei in Gold zu verwandeln. Alchemisten wollen sich von Unvollkommenheiten befreien und so ihr wahres Selbst finden.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "El objetivo de la alquimia no es solo convertir el plomo en oro, es purificarse de imperfecciones para alcanzar todo el potencial.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "L'alchimia non è soltanto trasformare il piombo in oro. È purificarsi dalle imperfezioni per trovare il tuo vero io.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "Alchemy is not just a matter of turning lead to gold. It's about purifying yourself of imperfections to become your true self.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "L'alchimie n'est pas que la transformation du plomb en or. C'est la purification de nos imperfections en vue de révéler notre vraie nature.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        }
      },
      "id": "01K5GZMJ9TR31DJ2NJJE60G4WJ",
      "text": "Alchemy is not just a matter of turning lead to gold. It's about purifying yourself of imperfections to become your true self."
    }
  ],
